---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Early-Support Indicator Flag
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> open : import, rule change or manual check - the latest value hits an active rule
    open --> caseOpened : Programme Head opens a case for an advisor (directly or by approving a take-on request)
    open --> dismissed : Programme Head dismisses with a reason
    open --> cleared : a later value no longer hits the rule, or the rule is no longer active
    caseOpened --> [*]
    dismissed --> [*]
    cleared --> [*]
